  <h1>The Diagnosis That Killed Children Within a Year</h1>
  <p class="dek">Before 1922, a child diagnosed with type 1 diabetes was put on a starvation diet and given roughly three years. The only treatment made them die slowly instead of quickly. That year, two men in Toronto found a way to keep them alive.</p>
